nd run `Scrappy.App.exe`.\n2. Install the APK on the tablet, open it, allow screen capture, and allow audio capture the first time you start a session.\n3. Press Scan, pick the tablet, press Start.\n\nUpgrade both ends together. The PC app and the tablet app share a version number.\n\n## Checksums\n\n`SHA256SUMS-0.2.1.txt` covers the three app files in this release.\n"}
